meta {
  name: Download volunteer feedback
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/volunteer/download/volunteerfeedback
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download Volunteer Feedback (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `volunteer_feedback` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows (no filters, no pagination) and converts the records to CSV using json2csv, and returns the CSV as raw file bytes with Content-Type: text/csv and Content-Disposition: attachment. The response is not JSON; frontend clients should read it as a Blob and trigger a browser download.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `authenticate()` and `authorize("read")`.
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv; charset=utf-8`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="volunteer_feedback.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per feedback submission with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID primary key |
  | `firstName` | Volunteer's first name |
  | `surname` | Volunteer's surname |
  | `programVolunteered` | Programme the volunteer participated in |
  | `specificProgramDetails` | Specific details about the programme |
  | `volunteerDuration` | Duration of volunteer service |
  | `overallExperienceRating` | Overall experience rating |
  | `roleClarityRating` | Rating of role clarity |
  | `teamSupportRating` | Rating of team support |
  | `organizationRating` | Rating of programme organisation |
  | `programMadeImpact` | Whether the volunteer felt the programme made an impact |
  | `waysProgramHelped` | Ways the programme helped |
  | `activitiesInvolvedIn` | Activities the volunteer was involved in |
  | `skillsDeveloped` | Skills developed during volunteering |
  | `skillsGained` | Skills gained through the experience |
  | `enjoyedMost` | What the volunteer enjoyed most |
  | `challengesExperienced` | Challenges experienced |
  | `improvementSuggestions` | Suggestions for improvement |
  | `continueVolunteering` | Whether the volunteer would continue |
  | `wouldRecommend` | Whether the volunteer would recommend the programme |
  | `additionalComments` | Any additional comments |
  | `submissionDate` | Date the feedback was submitted |
  | `updatedAt` | Last update timestamp |
  | `createdAt` | Creation timestamp |
  | `deletedAt` | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active) |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
